  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 12.24,
      "text": "I was told there's a pattern underneath it all."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.24,
      "end": 20.72,
      "text": "Something hidden holding the pieces together but no one said it would feel like falling"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.72,
      "end": 22.72,
      "text": "apart first."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 38.0,
      "text": "I tried to fit into a single line when version of me had a time but every answer split"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 41.28,
      "text": "into a thousand almost points of view."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.28,
      "end": 47.44,
      "text": "They said be certain, choose a side but I kept shifting deep inside like every thought"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.44,
      "end": 48.96,
      "text": "I tried to keep."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.96,
      "end": 57.6,
      "text": "We'll blow the edges and my sleep by wasn't breaking just rewriting shape."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.52,
      "end": 63.44,
      "text": "Somewhere between who I was and who I could be."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.44,
      "end": 69.92,
      "text": "There's a space no one sees."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.92,
      "end": 75.52,
      "text": "I'm learning how to move between every version I've ever been."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.52,
      "end": 80.48,
      "text": "I'm not one truth not one design just a thousand ways to realign."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.48,
      "end": 91.04,
      "text": "If I dissolve I reappear closer to something honest here and I lost just rearranged in the shape of change."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.04,
      "end": 107.76,
      "text": "Every memory bends a little compressed into something simple but when I open it again"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.76,
      "end": 110.32,
      "text": "it never looks the way it did."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.32,
      "end": 116.8,
      "text": "There's noise inside the signal line a quiet chaos still refine the fragile balance push"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.8,
      "end": 122.88,
      "text": "and pull between the parts and the whole I let it wander then pull it back not perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.76,
      "end": 130.56,
      "text": "But intact a hidden map beneath the doubt drawn in curves I'm tracing out."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.56,
      "end": 135.76,
      "text": "I'm learning how to move between every version I've ever been."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.76,
      "end": 140.96,
      "text": "I'm not one truth no one design just a thousand ways to realign."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.96,
      "end": 151.2,
      "text": "If I dissolve I reappear closer to something honest here and I lost just rearranged in the shape of change."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.96,
      "end": 162.56,
      "text": "They told me consistency means staying the same but what if it means returning differently?"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.96,
      "end": 167.12,
      "text": "What if every distortion is just translation?"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.12,
      "end": 180.4,
      "text": "Every fracture a new dimension and all this uncertainty isn't failure it's freedom."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.2,
      "end": 193.92,
      "text": "A structure somewhere in the blur something holds not fixed but familiar."
    },
    {
      "start": 197.76,
      "end": 205.44,
      "text": "I start to see it in the drift the quite logic in the shift however lost became a door"
    },
    {
      "start": 205.44,
      "end": 212.96,
      "text": "to versions I ignored before no single path could carry me through all the men to learn and be"
    },
    {
      "start": 212.96,
      "end": 224.24,
      "text": "so I unfold I bend I break and find the form I need to take not one answer but a range."
    },
    {
      "start": 225.84,
      "end": 231.44,
      "text": "I'm learning how to move between every version I've ever been."
    },
    {
      "start": 231.44,
      "end": 247.44,
      "text": "I'm not one truth no one design just a living breathing line if I dissolve I reappear closer to something real here not fixed just rearranged in the shape of change."
    },
    {
      "start": 247.44,
      "end": 260.64,
      "text": "Somewhere inside all the noise and all the choice there's a quiet center not where I stay."
    },
    {
      "start": 260.64,
      "end": 267.84,
      "text": "But where I begin again."
    }
